  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Life sphere (Stabilizing Invigoration), Weather sphere.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When you use control weather to create or control Precipitation of severity 2 or more, you may choose to spend 1 additional spell point. If you do, all dying creatures within the affected area immediately stabilize. Additionally, all allies have all bleed effects ended as if you had successfully used the Heal skill to perform first aid. This benefit lasts for 1 minute or until you stop concentrating on the control weather effect, whichever comes last.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/life#toc77\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
